This is only reached after `FlashInferCutlassNvFp4LinearKernel`, which needs the same `has_flashinfer()`. FlashInfer 0.7.2 also runs it from CUDA 12.9, not 13.

```suggestion
        if current_platform.has_device_capability(120) and has_flashinfer_b12x_gemm():
            return True, None
        return (
            False,
            "FlashInfer b12x requires SM120+ and FlashInfer "
            "with Sm120BlockScaledDenseGemmKernel",
        )
```

